\\mathbb L=\\langle L,R\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\mathbb Q,&lt;\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\mathbb Q,&lt;\\rangle\\)</span> (the standard countable dense linear order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetOrderEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetOrderEmbedding}_S\\)</span> are the linear-order and order-embedding predicates (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" href=\"?note=b40aa6d4a7d8288a\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fe34b1ba3bc153e\" href=\"?note=5fe34b1ba3bc153e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ScatteredLinearOrder}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ScatteredLinearOrder}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}scattered\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ScatteredLinearOrder}_S(\\mathbb L)\\leftrightarrow \\exists L,R\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb L=\\langle L,R\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(L,R)\\land\\neg\\exists e\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPosetOrderEmbedding}_S(e,\\mathbb Q,&lt;,L,R)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}scattered\\text{-}linear\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12ScatteredLinearOrder}_S(\\mathbb L)\\leftrightarrow \\exists L,R\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb L=\\langle L,R\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S(L,R)\\land\\neg\\exists e\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPosetOrderEmbedding}_S(e,\\mathbb Q,&lt;,L,R)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary scattered linear order definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fe34b1ba3bc153e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"b40aa6d4a7d8288a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcPosetOrderEmbedding}_S$ are the linear-order and order-embedding predicates (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]], [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fe34b1ba3bc153e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearOrder}_S$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcPosetOrderEmbedding}_S$ are the linear-order and order-embedding predicates (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-linear-order.md]], [[../batch11/58-df-zfc-poset-order-embedding.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb L,L,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb L=\\langle L,R\\rangl